{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26002","headline":"温泉宫 · 鲍溶","name":"温泉宫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忆昔开元天地平，武皇十月幸华清。\n山蒸阴火云三素，日落温泉鸡一鸣。\n彩羽鸟仙歌不死，翠霓童妾舞长生。\n仍闻老叟垂黄发，犹说龙髯缥缈情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26002.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26002","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}